<Slide notes={`脚本的核心结构其实很短，但它把两件事分得很干净。

左边是两次独立审阅。程序用一个线程池同时发起两个角色的调用，每个角色都自己构造指令和输入，用独立的客户端，返回的内容也写进各自的文件。角色之间没有隐式共享的聊天记录，所以它们的判断是彼此独立得出的。

右边是那一次汇总。必须等所有审阅都完成，才进入汇总步骤；只要有一个任务失败，整个交付就中止。整个程序里，只有汇总这一步会写最终报告。

命令只有一个参数，就是已有的排期文件。这份参考排期由人工编写，用来隔离学习变量，它不代表模型已经成功生成过排期。两次审阅加一次汇总都是真实调用，会产生费用。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.12.2　用 OpenAI API 实现最小分工</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>最小分工的程序结构</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 24, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>先用本地校验器检查给定排期，再把同一份输入分别交给两个角色</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 556, height: 288, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>两次独立审阅</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>线程池同时发起两个角色的调用</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>每个角色构造独立的指令与输入</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>每个角色使用独立的客户端</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>返回内容写入各自的文件</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>角色之间没有隐式共享的聊天记录</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 556, height: 288, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>一次统一汇总</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#26816B' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>所有审阅完成后才进入汇总</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#26816B' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>某个任务失败则中止本次交付</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#26816B' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>只有汇总步骤写最终报告</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 26, background: '#26816B' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>汇总吃两份审阅意见与确定性报告</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>程序读取已有排期文件，不生成新排期</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 760, height: 88, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>运行命令</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>python multi_agent.py fixtures/valid-schedule.json</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 376, height: 88, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>参考排期由人工编写</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不表示模型已成功生成排期；三次真实调用会产生费用</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.12 多 Agent 协作与工作流</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>09 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
